{"synopsis":"Di dunia tempat orang-orang tidur dan memasuki wilayah yang ditinggalkan oleh Dewa, Qin Feng, yang telah mengorbankan segalanya untuk saudara perempuannya, dikhianati olehnya. Namun, takdir memberinya kesempatan kedua, mengirimnya kembali sembilan tahun sebelum dunia yang ditinggalkan itu muncul. Kali ini, Qin Feng memilih untuk meninggalkan saudara perempuannya dan fokus untuk menjadi yang terkuat.","alternative_title":"网游：神级刺客，我即是暗影","author":"番茄小说, 无烬海工作室","artist":"番茄小说, 无烬海工作室","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"b1e9c7d3-2900-4066-9127-a307c4667460","number":"118","chapter":"118","title":"Chapter 118","date":"2026-07-29","released":"2026-07-29","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"a2e6e831-0ddc-42df-815b-3dbeac11e5cf","number":"117","chapter":"117","title":"Chapter 117","date":"2026-07-28","released":"2026-07-28","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"42e2306f-21b7-4afd-9ecb-9711ac9b9bc0","number":"116","chapter":"116","title":"Chapter 116","date":"2026-07-22","released":"2026-07-22","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"959e20ec-c744-428b-9388-65cfc26babc4","number":"115","chapter":"115","title":"Chapter 115","date":"2026-07-21","released":"2026-07-21","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ac75ef43-d212-4490-aa9f-92bd0f023285","number":"114","chapter":"114","title":"Chapter 114","date":"2026-07-19","released":"2026-07-19","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"0a341d3c-e287-4022-a6d7-6247bf7b8147","number":"113","chapter":"113","title":"Chapter 113","date":"2026-07-18","released":"2026-07-18","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"b1fd46ff-fc50-470c-a8ef-f6aef77966c9","number":"112","chapter":"112","title":"Chapter 112","date":"2026-07-12","released":"2026-07-12","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"962da962-8e92-4a9d-9a65-555c230326f1","number":"111","chapter":"111","title":"Chapter 111","date":"2026-07-09","released":"2026-07-09","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"be0cf2e6-1943-47ad-b8bf-9ca2b96200cc","number":"110","chapter":"110","title":"Chapter 110","date":"2026-07-06","released":"2026-07-06","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"02df0